text.en:
Subject to allocation by the President of the Philippines under the terms of Republic Act Numbered One thousand and subject to such rules and regulations as he may prescribe, the sum of twenty million pesos from the proceeds of the sales of bonds to be issued under Republic Act Numbered One thousand shall be reserved and utilized for projects of the People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation, as follows:
1. Construction of low-cost housing project, including site acquisition;
2. Acquisition and subdivision of landed estates for resale without structures;
3. Acquisition and clearance of slum areas; and
4. Construction of housing for destitutes and paupers.
